NATIONAL ASSEMBLY SECRETARIAT
SUPPLEMENTARY ORDERS OF THE DAY
for the meeting of the National Assembly to be held on Thursday, the 23'd January, 2025.
TO BE READ AFTER ITEM NO. 5
PRESENTATION OF THE REPORT OF THE STANDING COMMITTEE
6A. RAJA KHURRAM SHAHZAD NAWAZ, Chairman Standing Committee on lnterior topresent report of the Standing Committee on the Bill further to amend the Prevention ofElectronic Crimes Act, 2016 [The Prevention of Electronic Crimes (Amendment) Bill, 2025].
MOTION
68. SENATOR SYED MOHSIN RAZA NAQVI, Minister for lnterior, to move under rule 288 ofthe Rules of Procedure and Conduct of Business in the National Assembly, 2007 that therequirement of sub-rule (2) of rule 123 of the said Rules be dispensed with in order to take intoconsideration the Prevention of Electronic Crimes (Amendment) Bill, 2025.
TEGISTATIVE BUSINESS
6C. SENATOR SYED MOHSIN RAZA NAQVI, Minister for lnterior, to move that the Billfurther to amend the Prevention of Electronic Crimes Act, 2016 [The Prevention of ElectronicCrimes (Amendment) Bill, 20251, as reported by the Standing Committee, be taken intoconsideration at once.
6D. SENATOR SYED MOHSIN RAZA NAQVI, Minister for lnterior, to move that the Billfurther to amend the Prevention of Electronic Crimes Act, 2016 [The Prevention of ElectronicCrimes (Amendment) 8i11,20251, be passed.
TAHIR HUSSAINSecretary General
lslamabad, the23'd lanuarv,2o2i

endstream
